  <h1 id="GameFramework_DataStructures_SaveFileInfo" data-uid="GameFramework.DataStructures.SaveFileInfo" class="text-break">
    Class SaveFileInfo
    
  </h1>
  
  <div class="facts text-secondary">
    <dl><dt>Namespace</dt><dd><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.DataStructures.html">GameFramework.DataStructures</a></dd></dl>
    <dl><dt>Assembly</dt><dd>cs.temp.dll.dll</dd></dl>
  </div>
  
  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.DataStructures.SaveFileInfo.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="5">Represents information about a save file for display in the UI
Handles display formatting for timestamp-based saves and autosaves
Properly detects autosave files from both filename and session data
Uses TimeService-based playtime information for accurate display</p>
</div>
  <div class="markdown conceptual"></div>

